# Saved end-to-end session cookies — real access tokens. Regenerated each run.
# Leading ** matters: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to this file's
# directory, so a bare `e2e/.auth/` would never match apps/web/e2e/.auth/.
**/e2e/.auth/

